   "description": "Switching-time test set-up on a MAX628, which has one inverting and one non-inverting driver. VDD is 18 V, decoupled by 4.7 µF and 0.1 µF to ground. Each output drives a 1000 pF capacitor to ground. The inputs step between 0.4 V and 5 V with 5 ns edges. Delays run from the input's 10% point (rising) or 90% point (falling) to the output's 90% or 10% point; rise and fall times run between the output's 10% and 90% points.",
